{1 Adapters and the Runtime}

This package is parameterized by {!module-type:Awskit.Runtime.S} — it does
not contain any IO. You need a runtime adapter from the
{{:../awskit/index.html}[awskit]} package to make actual AWS calls.

See {{:../awskit/guides.html}[aws Guides]} for how to choose and configure an
adapter. In short: use [awskit-s3.eio] for new OCaml 5 projects, or
[awskit-s3.lwt_unix] for existing Lwt codebases.

